1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,780
Good morning.

2
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:07,960
As I'm sure you're aware, the gallery's management committee has requested an engineering survey of the site and its facilities.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:22,540
The aim of this survey is twofold: first, to find remedies for certain serious problems which have resulted in damage to the building and parts of the collection; secondly, to consider how the facilities can be improved.

4
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:28,100
I have to report to you that the structure of the building requires immediate attention.

5
00:00:28,695 --> 00:00:30,660
Neglect has resulted in serious damage.

6
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:36,440
I know that the necessary renovations will be expensive and funding is a problem.

7
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:43,360
But my consultants are certain that, if we act now, far more serious and expensive repairs can be avoided.
